arStrings.szText:
{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Whenever you cast a {c_important}Summon{/c} Skill or call a Mercenary for Reinforcement, one of your Summons or Mercenaries Stuns surrounding enemies for {c_random}[{SF_0}|2|]{/c} seconds and gains {c_number}[{SF_2}*100|1%|]{/c} Damage Reduction.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Your Summons deal {c_number}[{SF_12}*100|x%|]{/c} more damage, increased by {c_number}[{SF_8}|x2%|]{/c} for each {c_number}[1|%|]{/c} Bonus Critical Strike Damage you have from items and Paragon, up to a maximum of {c_random}[{SF_20}*100|x2%|]{/c}.
Current Bonus: {c_number}[{SF_7}*100|x2%|]{/c}{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
